{
    "title": "Epic War",
    "description": "The kingdom is under siege and your home is at stake.\r\nCreatures of darkness are devouring every living soul in their path. This is a war that you can\u2019t afford to lose.\r\nUnder your command, every unit counts. Lead your force to victory and glory, with meticulous planning and genius tactics! Are you prepared?\r\n\r\n1.Connect the same colored balls\r\nIn this super fun and relaxing puzzle game, you need to connect the same balls and ensure that the lines do not cross. You succeed when you can connect all the balls.\r\n\r\n2.Multiply the Forces\r\nCall your soldiers to disembark at the zombies. Do some simple maths from time to figure out what\u2019s the best shot to be taking. You need to hit gates that multiply your forces and overwhelm your foes before they\u2019ve got a chance to react!\r\n\r\n3. More is more\r\nDo you think troops of 50 or 100 units clashing against each other is impressive enough? Well, be re-impressed with a war on epic scale, 1,000 vs 1,000.\r\nThere are 11 unique types of units plus powerful heroes waiting for you. Feel the sheer power.\r\n\r\n4. Sandbox Strategy\r\nClaim the Dark Throne, revive the guardian dragon and brand this fantasy world with your name, as the king of kings!\r\n\r\nFacebook: https://www.facebook.com/EpicWarGlobal/\r\n\r\nPrivacy Policy: https://sites.google.com/view/ew-privacy-policy/\r\n\r\nTerms of Service: https://sites.google.com/view/ew-term-of-service/",
    "descriptionHTML": "The kingdom is under siege and your home is at stake.<br>Creatures of darkness are devouring every living soul in their path. This is a war that you can\u2019t afford to lose.<br>Under your command, every unit counts. Lead your force to victory and glory, with meticulous planning and genius tactics! Are you prepared?<br><br>1.Connect the same colored balls<br>In this super fun and relaxing puzzle game, you need to connect the same balls and ensure that the lines do not cross. You succeed when you can connect all the balls.<br><br>2.Multiply the Forces<br>Call your soldiers to disembark at the zombies. Do some simple maths from time to figure out what\u2019s the best shot to be taking. You need to hit gates that multiply your forces and overwhelm your foes before they\u2019ve got a chance to react!<br><br>3. More is more<br>Do you think troops of 50 or 100 units clashing against each other is impressive enough? Well, be re-impressed with a war on epic scale, 1,000 vs 1,000.<br>There are 11 unique types of units plus powerful heroes waiting for you. Feel the sheer power.<br><br>4. Sandbox Strategy<br>Claim the Dark Throne, revive the guardian dragon and brand this fantasy world with your name, as the king of kings!<br><br>Facebook: https://www.facebook.com/EpicWarGlobal/<br><br>Privacy Policy: https://sites.google.com/view/ew-privacy-policy/<br><br>Terms of Service: https://sites.google.com/view/ew-term-of-service/",
